.*

# ==== Global-gitignore overrides ====
# Our user-global ~/.config/git/ignore excludes design-docs/, CLAUDE.md, and .claude/.
# This repo tracks them, so override. The leading `.*` blanket also needs the
# tracked dot-directories re-included.
!design-docs
!CLAUDE.md
!.claude
!.claude/rules
!.claude/skills
!.claude/settings.json
!.github
!.bumpversion.toml

# Per-session harness state inside .claude/ — never committed.
.claude/scheduled_tasks.lock

# ==== Build outputs ====
# WebUI SPA bundled output (built by `mise //admin:build`), embedded into the
# cafleet binary at cargo-build time.
cafleet/webui-dist/

# Cargo build directory.
/cafleet/target/

# rspress documentation site built by `mise //docs:build`.
/docs/doc_build/

# ==== Toolchain caches ====
admin/node_modules/
/docs/node_modules/
.vite/

# ==== Generated content ====
# Research-shaped task folders — one per topic, produced by clean-docs runs and
# other research-shaped tasks.
/researches/

# ==== CAFleet runtime artifacts at the repo root ====
# Stray spawn-prompt audit writes at the repo root; the canonical location is
# per-task hidden `.prompts/` folders (`researches/<slug>/.prompts/`,
# `design-docs/<NNNNNNN>-<slug>/.prompts/`).
/.prompts/

# Spawn-prompt audit re-renders written by the Director when ${BASE} = repo root
# (${BASE}/<role>.md — one per spawned member-role per invocation).
/drafter.md
/drafter-resume.md
/reviewer.md
/programmer.md
/tester.md
/verifier.md
/analyzer.md

# Clarification-phase scratch (Director ↔ Drafter file-based relay when broker
# truncation cuts off long question/answer payloads).
/drafter-questions.md
/director-answers.md
